The maintained grammar, retaining this upstream history and MIT attribution,
is published at https://github.com/w0x7y/tree-sitter-revo.
The exact maintained revision is recorded in extension.toml.

languages/revo/highlights.scm is adapted from queries/highlights.scm in
Tree-sitter Revo. patches/tree-sitter-revo.patch also contains adapted
grammar, scanner and query code. The grammar and its query adaptations are by doomy and
contributors. The upstream grammar.js identifies doomy as the author and
MIT as the license; package.json and tree-sitter.json also declare MIT.

